  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Accessing the Green Climate Fund for enhanced ecosystems services and increased resilience in forestry and agriculture sector - (Recoded to Entity no. 732642 from biennium of funding 2022-23 to 2024-25)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To provide technical assistance to support the Government in accessing climate finance from GCF to advance its activities related to climate mitigation and adaptation in forestry, biodiversity, environment, agriculture and knowledge management; and to prepare a concept note for submission to GCF in the upcoming board meeting.</narrative>
  </description>
